flowchart TD
 C[Business command] --> DB[Business state + outbox transaction]
 DB --> O[Outbox publisher]
 O --> B[Broker partition by aggregate]
 B --> W[Bounded consumer worker]
 W --> V[Validate schema + tenant + aggregate version]
 V --> I{Inbox event ID already processed?}
 I -->|Yes| A[Ack duplicate]
 I -->|No| P[Apply local projection + inbox in one transaction]
 P --> A2[Ack after commit]
 V -->|Transient failure| R[Backoff + retry]
 R -->|Attempts exhausted| D[Dead-letter queue]
 H[Webhook ingress] --> S[Verify HMAC + timestamp + replay key]
 S --> C
 T[Scheduler] --> J[Deterministic scheduled event key]
 J --> O
